\begin{minipage}[b]{28pc}
\vspace{0.3cm}
{\sffamily {\bf{Fig. 7.}} Absolute differences {\it a)} and function replica {\it b)} at $c = 0.001$ (blue curves) and $c = 0.002$ (red curves). The parameters $h = 0.004$ and $N = 30$ are the same.}
