\begin{equation}\label{eq_fundementalsimulationmodel}
X_i=m(t_i, X_{i-1})+\sigma(t_i, X_{i-1})\epsilon_i.
\end{equation}
Note that we will let $\epsilon_i$ be a locally stationary and possibly nonlinear time series so that the variance of $\sigma(t_i, X_{i-1})\epsilon_i$ depends on both $X_{i-1}$ and $t_i.$ For the model (\ref{eq_fundementalsimulationmodel}), we will consider various settings as follows. 


