			also commutes. Summing up, we have shown that $\bar{\mathfrak{m}}_{(b,h,\nu)}$ coincides with $\mathfrak{m}_{(b,h,\nu)}$, which means that $\bar{\mathfrak{m}} = \mathfrak{m}$, concluding the proof.
		\end{proof}
