	\begin{corollary}
		The composite $\Theta \circ \Sigma$ is the identity 2-functor on $\CoLaxAlg_\star(\tilde T)$.
		\begin{proof}
			Analogous to Corollary \ref{cor:sigmatheta-identity}.
