\begin{proof}
    First, I let $\hat{\strat} (s_{j+2}) < 1$. I show that this implies $\hat{\strat}$ and $\hat{\strat}'$ induce equivalent outcomes under their respective experiments. The strategy $\strat': \signalset' \to [0,1]$ which replicates the outcome of $\hat{\strat}'$ under experiment $\experiment'$:
    %
    \begin{align*}
