\begin{abstract}
We show a special case of Steenbrink vanishing for rational singularities in positive characteristic.
As a consequence, we prove that strongly $F$-regular threefolds and klt threefolds in characteristic $p>41$ satisfy Steenbrink vanishing.
\end{abstract}

