 Let $X$ be a compact, smooth 4-manifold and $y \in \Wh_1(\pi_1(X);\Z/2 \times \pi_2(X))$. Let $F_y$ be as in \ref{con:allowed_1_for_theta}. Then $\Theta^{\TOP}(F_y)=y$.   
\end{lemma}
