An interesting correlation between $B(E2; 0^+_{_1} \rightarrow 2_{_1}^+)$ and $Q_{_S}(2_{_1}^+)$ values is inferred from {\it ab initio} calculations in $^{12}$C~\cite{calci2016sensitivities,d2020precision},
where the extrapolated $Q_{_S}(2_{_1}^+)$ value can be calculated precisely from the well-known $B(E2; 0^+_{_1} \rightarrow 2_{_1}^+)$~\cite{d2020precision}.
