Larger $Q_{_S}(2_{_1}^+)$ values can certainly be calculated by the shell model using larger effective charges~\cite{yuan2012,kitagawa1999shell,sagawa2004deformations},
as recently reviewed by Saiz and collaborators~\cite{saiz2021coulomb}.
